From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: v8-embed-feedstock <noreply@github.com>
Date: Tue, 2 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Translate LanguageStandard for the ninja generator too

common.gypi selects the C++ standard two ways, and which one depends on
the compiler: with clang it sets the MSBuild property LanguageStandard
(stdcpp20) and LanguageStandard_C (stdc11); with MSVC it puts -std:c++20
in AdditionalOptions, under a TODO to use LanguageStandard everywhere
once node-gyp understands it.

gyp's ninja generator does not understand it.  MSVSSettings.py lists
LanguageStandard as _MSBuildOnly, and msvs_emulation.py, which turns the
VCCLCompilerTool settings into cl.exe flags for ninja, has no case for
it, so a ninja build with clang=1 compiles with no /std: at all and V8
stops at v8config.h: "C++20 or later required."  Node never sees this:
its clang-cl builds go through MSBuild (vcbuild.bat), where the property
means what it says.

GetCflagsCC and GetCflagsC now emit /std: from those two settings -- the
same per-language split MSBuild gives them, which matters because a
-std:c++20 in AdditionalOptions reaches C files too, and clang-cl, unlike
cl.exe, refuses -std=c++20 for C.  Default, or no setting, adds nothing.
---
 tools/gyp/pylib/gyp/msvs_emulation.py | 17 +++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/gyp/pylib/gyp/msvs_emulation.py b/tools/gyp/pylib/gyp/msvs_emulation.py
--- a/tools/gyp/pylib/gyp/msvs_emulation.py
+++ b/tools/gyp/pylib/gyp/msvs_emulation.py
@@ -562,15 +562,30 @@
                 return ["/Yu" + pch, "/FI" + pch, "/Fp${pchprefix}." + pchbase + ".pch"]
         return []
 
+    def _GetLanguageStandardFlags(self, config, setting):
+        """The /std: flag for an MSBuild LanguageStandard / LanguageStandard_C
+        setting: stdcpp20 -> /std:c++20, stdcpplatest -> /std:c++latest,
+        stdc11 -> /std:c11.  Default, or no setting, adds nothing."""
+        standard = self._Setting(("VCCLCompilerTool", setting), config)
+        if not standard or standard == "Default":
+            return []
+        return ["/std:" + standard[len("std"):].replace("cpp", "c++", 1)]
+
     def GetCflagsC(self, config):
         """Returns the flags that need to be added to .c compilations."""
         config = self._TargetConfig(config)
-        return self._GetPchFlags(config, ".c")
+        return self._GetLanguageStandardFlags(
+            config, "LanguageStandard_C"
+        ) + self._GetPchFlags(config, ".c")
 
     def GetCflagsCC(self, config):
         """Returns the flags that need to be added to .cc compilations."""
         config = self._TargetConfig(config)
-        return ["/TP"] + self._GetPchFlags(config, ".cc")
+        return (
+            ["/TP"]
+            + self._GetLanguageStandardFlags(config, "LanguageStandard")
+            + self._GetPchFlags(config, ".cc")
+        )
 
     def _GetAdditionalLibraryDirectories(self, root, config, gyp_to_build_path):
         """Get and normalize the list of paths in AdditionalLibraryDirectories
